  "steps": [
    "Two-digit numbers have a TENS place and a ONES place.",
    "In the number 34: the 3 is in the tens place (3 tens = 30) and the 4 is in the ones place (4 ones = 4).",
    "Ten ones bundle together to make 1 ten!",
    "So 34 means 3 groups of ten and 4 extra ones."
  ],
